msgid ""
"You cannot create timesheets for a task that is linked to a time off type. "
"Please use the Time Off application to request new time off instead."
msgstr ""
"Za opravilo, ki je povezano z vrsto odsotnosti, ne morete ustvariti "
"časovnic. Namesto tega uporabite aplikacijo Odsotnosti in zahtevajte novo "
"odsotnost."

